{
  "id": "p3-ext-part4",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "load-guide",
      "type": "load-video",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "out/p3-ext-part3.mp4",
        "enable_audio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-frames",
      "type": "video-to-rgb",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_dtype": "u8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-tail",
      "type": "temporal-slice",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-frames",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "start": -90
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-guide-audio",
      "type": "load-audio",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "input_url": "out/p3-ext-part3.mp4",
        "start_s": 1.4167,
        "duration_s": 3.75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-pcm",
      "type": "audio-to-pcm",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "load-guide-audio",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_sample_rate": 32000,
        "channels": 2,
        "chunk_duration_s": 3.75,
        "max_chunk_duration_s": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "type": "minimax-h3-model-config",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "video_shift": 12.0,
        "audio_shift": 3.0,
        "condition_timestep": 1.0,
        "audio_seconds": 0.0,
        "lora": "Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex-ref2va",
        "lora_scale": 1.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model-select",
      "type": "model-select",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "hf_dir": "local/MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-8bit"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-guide",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-tail",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "video",
        "group_size": 0,
        "max_mb": 384
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-pcm",
      "type": "temporal-stack",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "guide-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "mode": "audio",
        "group_size": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-prompt",
      "type": "text-prompt",
      "iports": [],
      "config": {
        "text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the tabby cat in <Video 1>, with brown-and-black striped fur, a light blue denim jacket, white chest fur and pink paw pads.\n<Subject 2> is the worn wooden windowsill in <Video 1>, with flaking varnish, a chipped front edge, and warm sunlight lying across it.\n<Subject 3> is the view through the open window in <Video 1>, with a pale blue house wall, a strip of green hedge, and long late-afternoon shadows.\n<Video 1> is the source video whose final moment the target video continues from.\n<Audio 1> is the synchronized audio track of <Video 1>, providing the purring, the breeze and the distant birdsong to continue.\n\nsummary:\n[video continuation + audio reference] The target video continues directly from the end of <Video 1>. <Subject 1> is nearly asleep on <Subject 2>; a stronger puff of breeze from the window makes its ear flick and its tail flick once, and it does not fully wake; the purring and the outdoor ambience follow <Audio 1> without copying the signal.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is live-action and cinematic, with warm late-afternoon sunlight, a shallow depth of field, and soft fill light from the open window.\n[Shot 1] The shot continues seamlessly from the final moment of <Video 1>, keeping the same close framing. <Subject 1> lies relaxed on <Subject 2> with its chin close to the varnish, eyes nearly closed. A stronger gust comes through the open window of <Subject 3>, the hedge strip in the background shivers slightly, and the cat's near ear flicks back once while the tip of its tail flicks across the wood. It does not open its eyes. The sunlight on the sill has shifted slightly warmer and lower. The camera holds the close framing to the end of the video.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same individual tabby cat keeps its brown-and-black striped fur, light blue denim jacket, white chest fur and pink paw pads.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same worn windowsill with flaking varnish and the same chipped front edge.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the same pale blue house wall, green hedge strip and late-afternoon light direction.\n<Video 1> (continuation starting point): fully_preserved - [Shot 1] starts from the final framing, pose and lighting of <Video 1>.\n<Audio 1>: reference - the purring timbre, the breeze and the birdsong continue in the same character and tempo without copying the original signal.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe purring referenced from <Audio 1> continues at an even, sleepy tempo. The breeze through the window keeps its soft continuous character, and the distant birdsong continues, a little further away as the cat drifts toward sleep. One small tap of a claw on bare wood, then quiet.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNo musical score. Only the natural ambience referenced from <Audio 1> continues."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "video-ref-encoder",
      "type": "video-ref-encoder",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "text-prompt",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-guide",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "stack-pcm",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "frames": 124,
        "reference_video_short_edge": 0,
        "attach_audio": [
          2
        ],
        "max_prompt_tokens": 65536,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-video",
      "type": "generate-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "video-ref-encoder",
          "oport": 2
        },
        {
          "src": "minimax-h3-model-config",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "height": 480,
        "width": 832,
        "frames": 124,
        "fps": 24,
        "steps": 6,
        "seed": 42,
        "i8_gemm": true,
        "sol_attn": false,
        "unload_when_idle": "destroy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-vae-decode",
      "type": "audio-vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 1
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "vae-decode",
      "type": "vae-decode",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "generate-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "model-select",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "rgb-to-video",
      "type": "rgb-to-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "fps": 24,
        "pix_fmt": "yuv444p",
        "color_range": "full",
        "colorspace": "bt709"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "save-video",
      "type": "save-video",
      "iports": [
        {
          "src": "rgb-to-video",
          "oport": 0
        },
        {
          "src": "audio-vae-decode",
          "oport": 0
        }
      ],
      "config": {
        "output_url": "out/p3-ext-part4.mp4",
        "enable_video": true,
        "enable_audio": true,
        "video_codec": "ffv1",
        "video_bitrate": 10240000,
        "video_gop_size": 24,
        "audio_codec": "alac",
        "audio_bitrate": 192000,
        "muxer_options": {
          "movflags": "+faststart"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "subpipelines": []
}